   ** Second Comparative Solution Project:  Chappelear,J.E.,  and Nolen,J.S.,  "Second **
   ** Comparative Solution Project: A Three Phase Coning Study",Sixth SPE Symposium on **
   ** Reservoir Simulation,1982 (SPE 10489). This is a 3-phase,10x1x15, coning model.  **
